  Slug: school-of-the-boundary
  DisplayName: School of the Boundary
  IconPath: icons/sundries/books/book-face-black.webp
  Description: 'Why use your magic to affect something as pedestrian as the physical
    world? Whether you studied at the College of Dimensional Studies in Katapesh
    or an underground school in haunted Ustalav, you''ve turned your magic past the
    Universe to the forces beyond, summoning spirits and shades, manipulating dimensions
    and planes, and treading in a place not meant for mortals. Curriculum cantrips:
    @UUID[Compendium.pf2e.spells-srd.Item.Telekinetic Hand], @UUID[Compendium.pf2e.spells-srd.Item.Void
    Warp] 1st: @UUID[Compendium.pf2e.spells-srd.Item.Grim Tendrils], @UUID[Compendium.pf2e.spells-srd.Item.Phantasmal
    Minion], @UUID[Compendium.pf2e.spells-srd.Item.Summon Undead] 2nd: @UUID[Compendium.pf2e.spells-srd.Item.Darkness],
    @UUID[Compendium.pf2e.spells-srd.Item.See the Unseen] 3rd: @UUID[Compendium.pf2e.spells-srd.Item.Bind
    Undead], @UUID[Compendium.pf2e.spells-srd.Item.Ghostly Weapon] 4th: @UUID[Compendium.pf2e.spells-srd.Item.Flicker],
    @UUID[Compendium.pf2e.spells-srd.Item.Translocate] 5th: @UUID[Compendium.pf2e.spells-srd.Item.Banishment],
    @UUID[Compendium.pf2e.spells-srd.Item.Invoke Spirits] 6th: @UUID[Compendium.pf2e.spells-srd.Item.Teleport],
    @UUID[Compendium.pf2e.spells-srd.Item.Vampiric Exsanguination] 7th: @UUID[Compendium.pf2e.spells-srd.Item.Eclipse
    Burst], @UUID[Compendium.pf2e.spells-srd.Item.Interplanar Teleport] 8th: @UUID[Compendium.pf2e.spells-srd.Item.Quandary],
    @UUID[Compendium.pf2e.spells-srd.Item.Unrelenting Observation] 9th: @UUID[Compendium.pf2e.spells-srd.Item.Massacre]
    School Spells initial: @UUID[Compendium.pf2e.spells-srd.Item.Fortify Summoning];
    advanced: @UUID[Compendium.pf2e.spells-srd.Item.Spiral of Horrors]'
